      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GO HOME GIRL (4) continues to build a strong record, last start jumping favourite and hit the ground running, leading throughout to score (25.80) at this track in Grade 5 H over 460m. Superior out of the boxes and will be in the firing line early. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Looks the one to beat. NOVA OWEN (8) took the sit on the lead but levelled up to score (25.85) at this track in Grade 5 H over 460m. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Should be in this for a long way. ABDULLA ZULU (2) scored (25.93) last time out at this track adding to an already respectable career. Form at the trip excellent including five wins. Has a strong record from box 2, including three wins. Significant danger. MATCHBOX CYCLONE (1) is a last-start placegetter with solid claims again.",
